<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Rescue</h1>
<p>SKILL
</p><p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Dark Knight - 0
 Fighter     - 1
 Paladin     - 0
 Ranger      - 0
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>rescue &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>rescue asta
</pre>
<p>To help a friend in trouble, use this command. You jump between your friend and 
the one fighting them, so that the attacker fights you instead and your friend 
gets out of the battle; if you succeed, that is. It is a test of your rescue 
skill and dexterity against the attacker's dexterity.
</p><p>You can only rescue someone who is being attacked, and not from yourself.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Groups</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Assist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
</pre>




</div>